"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3987009712" "Oh, so sad, Duncan, that you think you can contain me. The Talons couldn't do it! It's just too bad I won't get to destroy Numina, but Mot needs me to be off to handle important business with the Circle of Thorns!"
