// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P631585059" "You overhear Diabolique yelling in the distance. Someone must be using powerful magic to bind her."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P482310004" "See what is holding Diabolique"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P4075321788" "Protect Scirocco and Serafina"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2855812872" "Scirocco"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4244075606" "{HeroName}, you've arrived just in time. It is coincidental that our paths have crossed at this moment."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3729615963" "We are fine. Mot's true power lies within the graveyard. As long as we've made peace with ourselves, he cannot take us."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3091343146" "{HeroName}, you must hold off Mot's forces while we bind Diabolique. We will stop her, here and now!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P726212334" "No!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4280831840" "Serafina, you must retreat. I will make a stand here with {HeroName}."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2697498414" "Let the beast come to us, {HeroName}. We shall slay it as many times as is required."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1983909185" "It is done, but I am sure it will return."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2017112646" "Serafina"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P365160754" "Scirocco, are you sure about this? I would hate to start believing in you only for this to be a trap!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2357498370" "Impossible...!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3286511645" "Bah! You, Serafina, and {HeroName} are all just insects compared to Mot! He'll absorb you where you stand!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2510986475" "Even as we speak, Mot's army marches here to free me!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2606428923" "Mmph. As for YOU, {HeroName}, the Sentinel will deal with you, -personally-!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2203972421" "Defiler"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
