// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2281765994" "We'll be carting Diabolique off now. Say goodbye to your friends, Tammy."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3916224762" "<t=2 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>ArE yoU fooLiSH eNOuGH<t=2 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>tO thInK I aM<t=2 caption x= 0.8 y=0.7 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>stIlL limiTED in mY<t=2 caption x= 0.6 y=0.6 d=6><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>feaSTing to JuST the<t=2 caption x= 0.2 y=0.6 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>guiLTY outSIdE of mY<t=2 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>doMAIN aLLoW me tO<t=2 caption x= 0.5 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor Maroon>demOnSTRATE my grOWing PoWER"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
